    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift, Deliver, Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as we knew it is gone. A cataclysmic interdimensional shift shattered reality, tearing open portals to unknown worlds. Through these rifts came horrors beyond imagination. But even in the apocalypse, people need their packages, and you're one of the few drivers willing to deliver.   <br>Armed with high-speed drift machines, heavy firepower, and pure skill, you\u2019ll need to slide, swerve, and shoot your way through the chaos to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about speed. It\u2019s about style, precision, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But deliveries are just treating the symptoms. As you navigate this hostile world, you\u2019ll uncover clues about the interdimensional catastrophe, gathering intel and experimental technology in pursuit of the ultimate goal...finding a way to permanently eradicate the monsters and close the portals for good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Drift or Die</strong> \u2013 Master fast-paced drifting mechanics to maintain speed, escape danger, squash hordes of monsters, and navigate the broken streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Customize &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Tune your car with adjustable suspension, turbo boosts, custom exhausts, wide-body kits, neon underglow, and liveries. Modify a variety of fictional JDM-inspired drift machines, muscle cars, and other popular high-performance vehicles, each with unique handling and combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b<strong>Weaponized Rides</strong> \u2013 Mount roof turrets, front-mounted machine guns, rear projectile launchers, EMP cannons, drift busters, and more\u00a0to clear your path. Customize your loadout to handle different monster threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Unlock</strong> \u2013 Discover new cars, powerful upgrades, and devastating weapons to enhance your drifting and combat abilities. Hunt for lost packages scattered across the city to find rare blueprints and unlock even more possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf<strong>Survive the Hordes</strong> \u2013 Battle against swarms of grotesque mutants and hulking monstrosities, each with its own deadly behavior. Some chase you down, others ambush from the shadows, some dash at breakneck speeds, while others explode or leach onto your car. Every monster will tear through entire city blocks just to get to you. Stay sharp, or become the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>High-Risk Deliveries</strong> \u2013 Speed through monster-infested streets to deliver vital supplies. The more dangerous the mission, the bigger the payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Numerous Monster Species</strong> \u2013 Over 90 species have already been identified, ranging from tiny, nimble creatures to towering, building-sized beasts. And with portals opening every day, more terrifying creatures are constantly pouring in. Adapt your strategy as new threats emerge from the interdimensional rifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Temporal Drift</strong> \u2013 When things get too hot, activate the Temporal Drift! Slow down time to give yourself the edge in tight situations, allowing you to dodge incoming attacks, navigate tricky corners, or take out hordes of monsters in slow motion. Master the flow of time to survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Dynamic Ruined City</strong> \u2013 A huge 9-kilometer-wide urban battlefield. Smash through barricades, drift around collapsed buildings, and take insane shortcuts to outmaneuver both monsters and rival delivery drivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/ba238ec53313ecb235512e9815107eaf.avif?t=1753116650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcd <strong>Eject &amp; Escape</strong> \u2013 When fully upgraded, your car isn\u2019t your only ride. In desperate situations, eject with a high-speed motorcycle and weave through the chaos to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Environmental Tactics</strong> \u2013 Use the city itself as a weapon. Freeze or electrify puddles, set trash piles ablaze, and trigger chain reactions to turn the tide against the monstrous hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong>Style &amp; Speed Matter</strong> \u2013 Drifting isn\u2019t just about getting from A to B. Chain monster kills to boost your EXP multiplier, extend drift length to amplify your damage, and pull off near-miss stunts for maximum style points. Drifting also charges certain upgrades, turning every turn into a tactical decision. More style means bigger rewards, better upgrades, and ultimate bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Dynamic Time and Weather</strong> \u2013 Experience a living, breathing city with a fully dynamic day-night cycle and ever-changing weather conditions. From stormy nights to sunny days, each shift affects gameplay and adds to the challenge as you drift through the ruined streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda0 <strong>Evolving Infestation</strong> \u2013 The monstrous infection spreads with each passing day, mutating the city and its creatures. Delay the inevitable or dive into the chaos\u2014adapt fast, or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>The Ultimate Mission</strong> \u2013 Beyond survival and deliveries, your true purpose is to find a way to wipe out the monsters forever and stop the interdimensional invasion at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU DELIVER IN HELL?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads are deadly. The monsters are relentless. <strong>Only the fastest, most fearless drifters will survive, and save our world.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift, Deliver, Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3062bc1a42b600b2d542afa9bd7d676b.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as we knew it is gone. A cataclysmic interdimensional shift shattered reality, tearing open portals to unknown worlds. Through these rifts came horrors beyond imagination. But even in the apocalypse, people need their packages, and you're one of the few drivers willing to deliver.   <br>Armed with high-speed drift machines, heavy firepower, and pure skill, you\u2019ll need to slide, swerve, and shoot your way through the chaos to complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about speed. It\u2019s about style, precision, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But deliveries are just treating the symptoms. As you navigate this hostile world, you\u2019ll uncover clues about the interdimensional catastrophe, gathering intel and experimental technology in pursuit of the ultimate goal...finding a way to permanently eradicate the monsters and close the portals for good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Drift or Die</strong> \u2013 Master fast-paced drifting mechanics to maintain speed, escape danger, squash hordes of monsters, and navigate the broken streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Customize &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Tune your car with adjustable suspension, turbo boosts, custom exhausts, wide-body kits, neon underglow, and liveries. Modify a variety of fictional JDM-inspired drift machines, muscle cars, and other popular high-performance vehicles, each with unique handling and combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2d5a4e3ebcca628aca7e0e090d38cc9a.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b<strong>Weaponized Rides</strong> \u2013 Mount roof turrets, front-mounted machine guns, rear projectile launchers, EMP cannons, drift busters, and more\u00a0to clear your path. Customize your loadout to handle different monster threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/4440df89cbfe06f79952221f1d3262cd.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Unlock</strong> \u2013 Discover new cars, powerful upgrades, and devastating weapons to enhance your drifting and combat abilities. Hunt for lost packages scattered across the city to find rare blueprints and unlock even more possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/72f1ef5cd38026324078dbe687aba0fe.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf<strong>Survive the Hordes</strong> \u2013 Battle against swarms of grotesque mutants and hulking monstrosities, each with its own deadly behavior. Some chase you down, others ambush from the shadows, some dash at breakneck speeds, while others explode or leach onto your car. Every monster will tear through entire city blocks just to get to you. Stay sharp, or become the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>High-Risk Deliveries</strong> \u2013 Speed through monster-infested streets to deliver vital supplies. The more dangerous the mission, the bigger the payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/2929841736cb3375786859964524faa0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Numerous Monster Species</strong> \u2013 Over 90 species have already been identified, ranging from tiny, nimble creatures to towering, building-sized beasts. And with portals opening every day, more terrifying creatures are constantly pouring in. Adapt your strategy as new threats emerge from the interdimensional rifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Temporal Drift</strong> \u2013 When things get too hot, activate the Temporal Drift! Slow down time to give yourself the edge in tight situations, allowing you to dodge incoming attacks, navigate tricky corners, or take out hordes of monsters in slow motion. Master the flow of time to survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/1032c9222f08adf5f8852c597a398af0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Dynamic Ruined City</strong> \u2013 A huge 9-kilometer-wide urban battlefield. Smash through barricades, drift around collapsed buildings, and take insane shortcuts to outmaneuver both monsters and rival delivery drivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/ba238ec53313ecb235512e9815107eaf.avif?t=1753116650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcd <strong>Eject &amp; Escape</strong> \u2013 When fully upgraded, your car isn\u2019t your only ride. In desperate situations, eject with a high-speed motorcycle and weave through the chaos to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/3e3e8ff3a7f811f1057cec554bb8a5d0.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Environmental Tactics</strong> \u2013 Use the city itself as a weapon. Freeze or electrify puddles, set trash piles ablaze, and trigger chain reactions to turn the tide against the monstrous hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/c59a2282a3d1cc957c34fe7f72be9870.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong>Style &amp; Speed Matter</strong> \u2013 Drifting isn\u2019t just about getting from A to B. Chain monster kills to boost your EXP multiplier, extend drift length to amplify your damage, and pull off near-miss stunts for maximum style points. Drifting also charges certain upgrades, turning every turn into a tactical decision. More style means bigger rewards, better upgrades, and ultimate bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/637f9ab2c25f5bef0d9c6b7cef53d548.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Dynamic Time and Weather</strong> \u2013 Experience a living, breathing city with a fully dynamic day-night cycle and ever-changing weather conditions. From stormy nights to sunny days, each shift affects gameplay and adds to the challenge as you drift through the ruined streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/98c5bc19eb056a2d7df818d36029bb92.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda0 <strong>Evolving Infestation</strong> \u2013 The monstrous infection spreads with each passing day, mutating the city and its creatures. Delay the inevitable or dive into the chaos\u2014adapt fast, or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.poster.avif?t=1753116650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.webm?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594740/extras/f3b39755ac04a4fb8cb657e851522f58.mp4?t=1753116650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>The Ultimate Mission</strong> \u2013 Beyond survival and deliveries, your true purpose is to find a way to wipe out the monsters forever and stop the interdimensional invasion at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU DELIVER IN HELL?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads are deadly. The monsters are relentless. <strong>Only the fastest, most fearless drifters will survive, and save our world.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "TURBO-DRIFTING, MONSTER-SQUASHING ROGUE-LITE. Deliver packages, transport survivors, and crush hordes of interdimensional invaders as you upgrade your ride in a crumbling post-apocalyptic city. Drift, squash, upgrade, deliver, repeat!",
